  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a master of disarming foes.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Disarming Strike<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may expend a use of mythic power to use Disarming Strike on any successful melee attack. Additionally, whenever you successfully disarm a foe you may choose to tuck the weapon into a belt or open container it fits.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc81\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
